   - `new`: creates a new empty collection of shapes.
   - `add_shape`: adds a new shape to the collection.
   - `get_dimensions`: retrieves the width and height of a shape given its identifier.
   - `calculate_total_area`: calculates the total area of all shapes in the collection (sum of width * height for each shape).

